      "description": "Popeyes Rewards is for fried chicken fans who want every eligible Popeyes order to take them closer to food rewards, exclusive offers and member experiences.\n\nEarn 100 points for every £1 spent on eligible purchases. Build your points balance, redeem points for Popeyes favourites and access member-only offers, surprises and experiences through the Popeyes UK app.\n\nWhy not order ahead? Order Louisiana-style fried chicken to eat-in, for delivery or collection, discover our best meal deals and find your nearest Popeyes restaurant. Whether it's our iconic sandwiches, wings, tenders or all your favourites in our Box Meals - we've got you covered.\n\nHOW DOES POPEYES REWARDS WORK?\nJoin through the Popeyes UK app and earn 100 points for every £1 spent on eligible purchases.\n\nWHAT CAN I SPEND MY POINTS ON?\nRedeem your points against available Popeyes food rewards in the app.\n\nCAN I EARN POINTS ON DELIVERY ORDERS?\nYou can earn points on orders through our app. Orders placed through third-parties aren't eligible\n\nWHAT ELSE DO MEMBERS RECEIVE?\nMembers can access exclusive offers* and our incredible Mardi Gras prizes*.\n*Subject to terms and conditions.\n\nCAN I ORDER FOR DELIVERY OR COLLECTION?\nUse the Popeyes UK app to choose an available restaurant and order for delivery or collection.",
